  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "streamQuery(): SQL delta em temp_to_zenddesk_companies (COALESCE(updated_at, created_at), tz BRT; ORDER BY company_id)",
        "mapRow() (BigQueryRowMapper) → ZendeskMapper::toOrganization() → ZendeskOrganizationDTO (plan só p/ novas)",
        "splitBatch(): updated_at > created_at → update; senão → create (updateMany vs createMany)",
        "Batches ≤100 → Parallel (concurrency_orgs) → job_id → pollJobStatus → updateLocalMapping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Rate limit (Zendesk)",
      "items": [
        "throttleRequest(): mínimo 600ms entre requisições (~100 req/min)",
        "requestWithRetry(): MAX_ATTEMPTS=3; Connect/Server → backoff 2^n (1/2/4s)",
        "429 → Retry-After; esgotado → TransientZendeskException; outros 4xx → PermanentValidationException",
        "pollJobStatus(): backoff 2/5/10/30s, timeout 300s (ZENDESK_JOB_POLL_TIMEOUT_S); failed/killed → TransientZendeskException",
        "esperas via Coroutine::sleep() — não bloqueiam worker Swoole"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Resume e estado (MySQL)",
      "items": [
        "useDeduplication() = false: dedup Redis (sha256, TTL 30d) off para organizations",
        "Resume: organizations_mapping com synced_at = hoje em loadAlreadySyncedIds() → skipped_resume",
        "Reconcílio grava zendesk_organization_id em organizations_mapping (updateLocalMapping)",
        "Falhas por stage: missing_id, batch_failure, per_record, unmatched_result"
      ]
    }
  ]
